    "notes": "Rule 27(a) NUC two all-round red + two balls, sidelights and sternlight when making way; 27(b) RAM red-white-red + ball-diamond-ball, masthead lights, sidelights, sternlight when making way; Rule 18(a) power-driven vessel keeps out of the way of NUC and RAM; Rule 30(d) aground: anchor lights + two all-round red."
